@startuml notification_system_sequence
title Notification System

actor User
actor Teacher
actor Student

boundary "NotificationPage" as UI
control "NotificationController" as Controller
control "NotificationService" as NotificationService
control "TestService" as TestService
control "ClassService" as ClassService
control "EventService" as EventService
entity "NotificationRepository" as Repository
database "Database" as DB

' =====================================================
' CASE 1: XEM THÔNG BÁO
' =====================================================
== Xem danh sách thông báo ==

User -> UI: Mở trang thông báo
UI -> Controller: GET /api/notifications

Controller -> NotificationService: getNotifications(userId)
NotificationService -> Repository: getByUserId(userId)

Repository -> DB: SELECT notifications
DB --> Repository: Notifications

Repository --> NotificationService: List Notifications
NotificationService --> Controller: Notifications

Controller --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> User: Hiển thị danh sách

' =====================================================
' CASE 2: ĐÁNH DẤU ĐÃ ĐỌC
' =====================================================
== Đánh dấu đã đọc ==

User -> UI: Chọn thông báo

UI -> Controller: PUT /api/notifications/{id}/read

Controller -> NotificationService: markAsRead(id)

NotificationService -> Repository: updateReadStatus(id)

Repository -> DB: UPDATE notifications
DB --> Repository: Success

Repository --> NotificationService: Success
NotificationService --> Controller: Success

Controller --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> User: Cập nhật trạng thái

' =====================================================
' CASE 3.1: GIÁO VIÊN TẠO BÀI KIỂM TRA
' =====================================================
== Giáo viên tạo bài kiểm tra ==

Teacher -> UI: Tạo bài kiểm tra
UI -> Controller: POST /api/tests

Controller -> TestService: createTest()

TestService -> DB: INSERT test
DB --> TestService: Test Created

TestService -> EventService: dispatch(TestCreated)

EventService -> NotificationService: handleTestCreated()

NotificationService -> Repository: createNotification()

Repository -> DB: INSERT notifications
DB --> Repository: Success

Repository --> NotificationService: Success

TestService --> Controller: Success
Controller --> UI: 201 Created

UI --> Teacher: Tạo bài thi thành công

' =====================================================
' CASE 3.2: HỌC SINH THAM GIA LỚP HỌC
' =====================================================
== Học sinh tham gia lớp học ==

Student -> UI: Tham gia lớp học
UI -> Controller: POST /api/classes/join

Controller -> ClassService: joinClass()

ClassService -> DB: INSERT class_student
DB --> ClassService: Success

ClassService -> EventService: dispatch(StudentJoinedClass)

EventService -> NotificationService: handleStudentJoinedClass()

NotificationService -> Repository: createNotification()

Repository -> DB: INSERT notifications
DB --> Repository: Success

Repository --> NotificationService: Success

ClassService --> Controller: Success
Controller --> UI: 200 OK

UI --> Student: Tham gia lớp thành công

note right of EventService

Observer Pattern

- TestCreated Event
- StudentJoinedClass Event

Tách biệt nghiệp vụ chính
và nghiệp vụ gửi thông báo

Dễ mở rộng:
- Email
- Realtime
- SMS

end note

@enduml